    18	 * The all-absent case is the reason this file exists. This molecule's recipe carries a
    19	 * `paddingTop`, and padding is unconditional — unlike the `gap` that every other group in
    20	 * ui-kits/ relies on, it does not collapse when the children render nothing. Without the guard
